  "tooltip.anvilcraftplasticraft.color": "Color: %s",
  "tooltip.anvilcraftplasticraft.item.clear_plastic": "Clear plastic products that tint beacon beams like stained glass and do not conduct redstone",
  "tooltip.anvilcraftplasticraft.item.clear_plastic.shift": "Spectral Anvils can pass through it\nLasers pass through it without dealing damage\nAll 16 dye colours tint beacon beams like their stained-glass counterparts",
  "tooltip.anvilcraftplasticraft.item.clear_plastic_granule": "Transparent plastic feedstock for molding",
  "tooltip.anvilcraftplasticraft.item.clear_plastic_melt_bucket": "Transparent plastic melt for clear molded products",
  "tooltip.anvilcraftplasticraft.item.clear_plastic_melt_bucket.shift": "Made from plastic oil with tempering glass or frost glass; frost glass runs at half speed and all 16 dye colours are supported",
  "tooltip.anvilcraftplasticraft.item.condenser_tower": "A stackable 3x3x3 module that condenses vapor above a large cauldron",
  "tooltip.anvilcraftplasticraft.item.condenser_tower.shift": "Each module stores 64 buckets and exposes four output-only ports\nOil is separated into high-heat fuel, plastic oil, and crude-oil essence across the first three layers\nCapping the top-center outlet makes a full module apply backpressure to the entire stack",
  "tooltip.anvilcraftplasticraft.item.crude_oil_acid_bucket": "Contains mysterious power and can be converted into many forms",
  "tooltip.anvilcraftplasticraft.item.elastic_plastic": "Smooth translucent plastic products that bounce without slowing surface walking",
  "tooltip.anvilcraftplasticraft.item.elastic_plastic.shift": "Walking across the surface does not slow you down or trigger small bounces\nRebounds lose some speed each time and cushion falling entities\nSneak to suppress the landing bounce\nAll molded shapes retain the material's elasticity",
  "tooltip.anvilcraftplasticraft.item.elastic_plastic_granule": "Elastic plastic feedstock for bouncy molded products",
  "tooltip.anvilcraftplasticraft.item.elastic_plastic_melt_bucket": "Resin-catalyzed melt for translucent, bouncy plastic products",
  "tooltip.anvilcraftplasticraft.item.elastic_plastic_melt_bucket.shift": "Resin and items crafted from it catalyze plastic oil over a cold block\nA hardened resin cauldron acts as its own catalyst; catalysts are not consumed\nSupports all 16 dye colours",
  "tooltip.anvilcraftplasticraft.item.engineering_plastic": "High-strength plastic that blocks lasers and whose molded demolition tools preserve broken blocks",
  "tooltip.anvilcraftplasticraft.item.engineering_plastic.shift": "Molded anvils break targets above stonecutters with Silk Touch\nLasers at level 5 or above destroy the engineering plastic they hit",
  "tooltip.anvilcraftplasticraft.item.engineering_plastic_granule": "Solid engineering plastic feedstock retaining its melt colour",
  "tooltip.anvilcraftplasticraft.item.engineering_plastic_melt_bucket": "Royal-steel-reinforced melt for molding engineering plastic products",
  "tooltip.anvilcraftplasticraft.item.engineering_plastic_melt_bucket.shift": "Convert universal plastic melt with any frost-metal item without external cooling\nRoyal-steel items instead require a cold block directly below the melt",
  "tooltip.anvilcraftplasticraft.item.hardend_resin_anvil": "A hardened resin anvil that functions as a complete anvil",
  "tooltip.anvilcraftplasticraft.item.hardend_resin_anvil.shift": "Rename it for free; falling does not damage it\nAny actual bottom-face landing can process recipes, with no minimum drop\nInserting a magnet lets magnets pull it",
  "tooltip.anvilcraftplasticraft.item.hardend_resin_cauldron": "A portable resin cauldron that catalyzes plastic oil into elastic melt over a cold block",
  "tooltip.anvilcraftplasticraft.item.heat_resistant_plastic": "Heat-resistant plastic that blocks lasers and is immune to fire and laser damage",
  "tooltip.anvilcraftplasticraft.item.heat_resistant_plastic.shift": "Molded anvils break targets above stonecutters with Smelting\nThe anvil behaves like an Ember Anvil when it lands\nIt blocks lasers without taking laser damage",
  "tooltip.anvilcraftplasticraft.item.heat_resistant_plastic_granule": "Solid heat-resistant plastic feedstock retaining its melt colour",
  "tooltip.anvilcraftplasticraft.item.heat_resistant_plastic_melt_bucket": "Ember-metal-reinforced melt for fire-resistant plastic products",
  "tooltip.anvilcraftplasticraft.item.heat_resistant_plastic_melt_bucket.shift": "Convert universal plastic melt with an item in the anvilcraftplasticraft:ember_metal_items tag\nThe reaction needs heat directly below and preserves the melt colour\nHeat-resistant products are immune to fire",
  "tooltip.anvilcraftplasticraft.item.high_heat_fuel_bucket": "Ignites high-temperature plasma jets; they burn fiercely but consume fuel quickly",
  "tooltip.anvilcraftplasticraft.item.high_viscosity_resin_block": "A well-sealed resin block that is genuinely sticky",
  "tooltip.anvilcraftplasticraft.item.high_viscosity_resin_block.shift": "Elastic and strongly sticks to adjacent blocks\nCaptures creatures of any size; hostile creatures must be weakened\nCaptures Wither Skulls\nEach resin-connected group counts as one block against a piston's push limit",
  "tooltip.anvilcraftplasticraft.item.liquid_high_viscosity_resin_bucket": "Highly adhesive and non-volatile; it appears to need thousands of years to solidify",
  "tooltip.anvilcraftplasticraft.item.liquid_high_viscosity_resin_bucket.shift": "Right-click an entity, then right-click a block or another entity to bond the two\nRight-click a block to place a blob of adhesive that sticks entities it touches",
  "tooltip.anvilcraftplasticraft.item.plastic_3d_printing_component": "Installed above the Plastic Molding Chamber, it prints precise plastic products",
  "tooltip.anvilcraftplasticraft.item.plastic_oil_bucket": "Can be converted into different plastic melts in several ways",
  "tooltip.anvilcraftplasticraft.item.resin_anvil": "A resin block kneaded into an anvil shape, full of elasticity",
  "tooltip.anvilcraftplasticraft.item.resin_anvil.shift": "Its elasticity means it cannot repair equipment or enchantments\nAny actual bottom-face landing can process recipes, with no minimum drop\nInserting a magnet lets magnets pull it",
  "tooltip.anvilcraftplasticraft.item.resin_anvil_hammer": "A lightweight anvil hammer made from an elastic resin anvil",
  "tooltip.anvilcraftplasticraft.item.resin_anvil_hammer.shift": "Attacks deal no damage but launch targets a long way; hitting a block launches you too\nCan be repaired with resin; repairs in a Hardened Resin Anvil cost no experience",
  "tooltip.anvilcraftplasticraft.item.universal_plastic": "Ordinary plastic that blocks lasers and breaks when hit by a level 5 or stronger beam",
